WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:05.470
So as most of you know, I am not with Joe
Biden on healthcare.

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:10.570
Joe Biden is starting the negotiation from
a very centrist point, which is let's tweak

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:13.750
Obamacare and add a public option.

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:20.240
We'd be lucky to get to that if you start
the conversation at the most progressive point,

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:23.509
if that's where Joe starts, we won't even
get that.

00:00:23.509 --> 00:00:25.449
And I'm not with them whatsoever.

00:00:25.449 --> 00:00:28.679
I'm not with Joe Biden on cannabis legalization.

00:00:28.679 --> 00:00:29.679
He's against it.

00:00:29.679 --> 00:00:30.699
I'm for it.

00:00:30.699 --> 00:00:35.620
Joe Biden recently said cannabis is a gateway
drug that's been widely debunked beyond it

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:40.270
being a gateway to violence when it's illegal,
because people have to get into situations

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:44.170
that are less than savory in order to get
their cannabis.

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:46.410
But beyond that, it's not a gateway drug.

00:00:46.410 --> 00:00:48.450
I am well to Joe Biden's left.

00:00:48.450 --> 00:00:54.260
I'm a Warren Bernie guy, but I must tell you
I reviewed Joe Biden's tax plan and it's like

00:00:54.260 --> 00:01:00.710
sort of okay in a very mild way, I guess I'm
saying it's not terrible given lots of Joe

00:01:00.710 --> 00:01:01.710
Biden's other positions.

00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:06.280
Now of course there is no wealth tax and Biden's
plan, he told a group of wealthy donors behind

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:08.810
closed doors that their wealth is basically
safe.

00:01:08.810 --> 00:01:13.680
If he becomes president, he won't do anything
to radically change or challenge their privileged

00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:15.290
position in society.

00:01:15.290 --> 00:01:21.630
That's not a surprise, but given how off Joe
Biden has been in so, so many other areas,

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:24.369
his tax plan is better than I would have expected.

00:01:24.369 --> 00:01:26.119
So let's take a look at it and discuss it.

00:01:26.119 --> 00:01:27.979
Let's go through some of our bigger deals
than others.

00:01:27.979 --> 00:01:34.160
First of all, taxing capital gains and dividends
as income is huge right now.

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:39.579
Capital gains taxes max out at 20% so if you're
a wealthy person who would pay the top rate

00:01:39.579 --> 00:01:46.450
on earned income money you make via dividends
and capital gains is only taxed at 20% if

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:52.140
you tax capital gains and dividends has ordinary
income, you will collect significantly more

00:01:52.140 --> 00:01:57.810
money from the very rich who are mostly earning
money from dividends and capital gains own

00:01:57.810 --> 00:01:58.810
businesses.

00:01:58.810 --> 00:02:02.490
They own stocks they owned, for example, rather
than labor.

00:02:02.490 --> 00:02:03.829
This is a big deal.

00:02:03.829 --> 00:02:08.070
Of course, people will find ways to try to
get around it, but this is a really big deal.

00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:12.390
A Joe Biden would raise the corporate tax
rate to 28% this is fine.

00:02:12.390 --> 00:02:17.750
Trump lowered it from 35 to 21 but what's
important to remember is that huge corporations

00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:22.830
often don't play it, pay anything close to
what the corporate tax rate is anyway because

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:24.050
of loopholes.

00:02:24.050 --> 00:02:26.790
Many corporations pay zero or even get tax
credits.

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:30.640
So I agree that we should bring the corporate
tax rate back up.

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:32.080
This is not some miracle.

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:35.800
Uh, and let's not make it out to be one because
there are lots of ways to get around paying

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:38.110
any corporate tax as it is.

00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:41.220
Joe Biden would end the stepped up basis rule.

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:42.830
This really benefits the rich.

00:02:42.830 --> 00:02:49.070
The way this works is if I buy $1,000 worth
of stock and I sell it for $10,000 I've profited

00:02:49.070 --> 00:02:55.790
$9,000 you take the 10,000 you subtract out
my basis, which was the thousand bucks I paid,

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:59.120
so I pay taxes on the $9,000 gain.

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:03.950
Stepped up basis means that in certain situations,
for example, if shares are inherited when

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:08.620
someone dies, the recipient is able to step
up their cost basis.

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:16.080
So those same thousand dollars shares, if
I inherit them when they are worth $9,000

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:24.610
and then sell them for $10,000 I am able to
step up my basis to $9,000 and now I only

00:03:24.610 --> 00:03:33.340
pay taxes on a gain of a thousand between
9,000 and 10,000 rather than that full gain,

00:03:33.340 --> 00:03:35.030
Biden would get rid of that.

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:38.310
A Biden would put in place a 15% corporate
minimum tax.

00:03:38.310 --> 00:03:39.750
Now this is a good idea.

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:41.290
The devil is in the details.

00:03:41.290 --> 00:03:46.551
The minimum tax suggests that you've got your
official corporate tax rate of 28% you can

00:03:46.551 --> 00:03:51.760
start to take the deduction to lower your
effective tax rate, but the minimum tax would

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:57.110
say that no matter what deductions you're
entitled to, you can't deduct yourself to

00:03:57.110 --> 00:04:01.230
a point where you pay below a 15% tax rate.

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:02.530
That's a great idea.

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:07.030
The problem is often there are deductions
that are exempted from that, so it's all in

00:04:07.030 --> 00:04:08.330
the implementation.

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:09.860
Still a fine idea.

00:04:09.860 --> 00:04:15.340
21% tax on foreign profits, fine, but again,
a lot of it is how do you implement it?

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:18.250
Capping deductions for the wealthy is fine.

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:22.100
Cracking down on tax havens is a good one,
but it's vague.

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:26.120
There will very often be, you know, other
countries that enter with other opportunities

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:28.020
to avoid taxes.

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:30.080
It's the right idea.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:32.800
Implementing it effectively is very difficult.

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:37.290
Biden would raise the top tax rate to 39.6%
now that's fine.

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:42.470
That's the top rate we had under the Obama
presidency after the Bush tax cuts expired.

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:47.000
Again, lots of rich people earn through capital
gains and dividends anyway.

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:52.410
What I would like to see are higher marginal
tax rates established for higher levels of

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:53.410
income.

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:59.080
You know, a new higher rate for a million
and above, an even higher rate for 5 million,

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:00.680
10 million and above.

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:01.720
Biden doesn't do that.

00:05:01.720 --> 00:05:07.350
It's not surprising, but at least he's rolling
back the uh, put, putting the top tax rate

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:10.560
back to where it was under Barack Obama.

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:14.550
Biden would also close real estate loopholes
and end fossil fuel tax breaks.

00:05:14.550 --> 00:05:15.550
That's fine.

00:05:15.550 --> 00:05:20.290
The devil is in the details, so this is a
fine left of center tax plan.

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:22.670
It's way better than what we have.

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:26.230
It won't do anything about the military industrial
complex.

00:05:26.230 --> 00:05:28.550
That's a budgeting thing on the spending side.

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:29.930
That's not a revenue thing.

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:31.840
It doesn't fix healthcare.

00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:32.970
That's a separate issue.

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:39.370
Joe's plan is very milk toast centrist on
healthcare, but calling things what they are,

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:44.050
it's a tax plan that goes in the right direction
with some good tweaks.

00:05:44.050 --> 00:05:48.930
It doesn't really shake anything up, which
is exactly what Joe Biden promised rich people.

00:05:48.930 --> 00:05:53.790
Once again, I don't agree with much of his
policy, but Joe's being honest, he told those

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:59.380
rich people, nothing will fundamentally change
and challenge your privileged status in society,

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:03.270
which is widely unquestioned at the top echelons
of power.

00:06:03.270 --> 00:06:06.540
He told us that that's what he would do and
that's exactly what his tax plan would do

00:06:06.540 --> 00:06:09.260
while doing some okay things.

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:11.170
Let me know what you think about this tax
plan.

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:12.630
I know the wealth tax is missing.

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:16.360
I know higher tax brackets at higher income
levels are missing.

00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:17.810
I get all of that.

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:18.840
Let me know what you think.

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:21.070
I'm on Instagram at David dot.

